{
	"info": {
		"name": "Microservices - ROTEIRO de Testes",
		"description": "Colecao gerada a partir do ROTEIRO.md. Contém todos os endpoints para cada passo de teste do ecossistema de microservices. Padroes estudados: Service Discovery (Eureka), API Gateway, Saga (Orquestracao), Circuit Breaker (Resilience4j), Event-Driven (Kafka), Load Balancing (Spring Cloud LoadBalancer), Compensating Transactions.\n\nSEGURANÇA: Todos os endpoints protegidos já enviam o header Authorization com Bearer token obtido via Keycloak. Para autenticar como user1 (ROLE_USER) ou admin (ROLE_USER+ROLE_ROLE_ADMIN), execute o request \"Login user1\" ou \"Login admin\" na pasta \"Autenticação\" antes de prosseguir.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{accessToken}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8080"
		},
		{
			"key": "vendasUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8081"
		},
		{
			"key": "estoqueUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8082"
		},
		{
			"key": "pagamentoUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8083"
		},
		{
			"key": "freteUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8084"
		},
		{
			"key": "eurekaUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8761"
		},
		{
			"key": "keycloakUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8180",
			"description": "URL do Keycloak (externo, para login via Postman)"
		},
		{
			"key": "keycloakIssuer",
			"value": "http://keycloak:8180/realms/microservices",
			"description": "Issuer URI interno (usado pelos services no Docker)"
		},
		{
			"key": "accessToken",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Token JWT obtido via login no Keycloak. Preenchido automaticamente pelo script de pré-requisito ou manualmente via request 'Login user1'."
		},
		{
			"key": "pedidoId",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Preencha com o UUID retornado ao criar um pedido (Passo 7)"
		},
		{
			"key": "reservaId",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Preencha com o ID da reserva de estoque"
		},
		{
			"key": "freteId",
			"value": "",
			"description": "Preencha com o ID do frete"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "0 - Autenticacao (Keycloak)",
			"description": "Execute um dos requests de login ANTES de usar os endpoints protegidos. O token JWT sera salvo automaticamente na variavel de colecao 'accessToken'.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login user1 (ROLE_USER)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.access_token);",
									"    console.log('Token salvo com sucesso (user1). Expira em ' + jsonData.expires_in + 's');",
									"} else {",
									"    console.error('Falha ao obter token: ' + JSON.stringify(jsonData));",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"url": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/microservices/protocol/openid-connect/token",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{
									"key": "grant_type",
									"value": "password"
								},
								{
									"key": "client_id",
									"value": "gateway-public"
								},
								{
									"key": "username",
									"value": "user1"
								},
								{
									"key": "password",
									"value": "Password123"
								},
								{
									"key": "scope",
									"value": "openid"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Autentica user1 via Resource Owner Password Credentials (ROPC). Salva o access_token na variavel de colecao 'accessToken'.\n\nRoles: ROLE_USER\nCredenciais: user1 / Password123"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Login admin (ROLE_USER + ROLE_ADMIN)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.access_token);",
									"    console.log('Token salvo com sucesso (admin). Expira em ' + jsonData.expires_in + 's');",
									"} else {",
									"    console.error('Falha ao obter token: ' + JSON.stringify(jsonData));",
									"}"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"url": "{{keycloakUrl}}/realms/microservices/protocol/openid-connect/token",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{
									"key": "grant_type",
									"value": "password"
								},
								{
									"key": "client_id",
									"value": "gateway-public"
								},
								{
									"key": "username",
									"value": "admin"
								},
								{
									"key": "password",
									"value": "Admin123"
								},
								{
									"key": "scope",
									"value": "openid"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Autentica admin via Resource Owner Password Credentials (ROPC). Salva o access_token na variavel de colecao 'accessToken'.\n\nRoles: ROLE_USER, ROLE_ADMIN\nCredenciais: admin / Admin123"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Decodificar Token (debug)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var token = pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken');",
									"if (!token) {",
									"    tests['Nenhum token salvo'] = true;",
									"    return;",
									"}",
									"var parts = token.split('.');",
									"if (parts.length !== 3) {",
									"    tests['Token invalido'] = true;",
									"    return;",
									"}",
									"var payload = JSON.parse(atob(parts[1]));",
									"console.log('=== PAYLOAD DO TOKEN ===');",
									"console.log(JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2));",
									"console.log('Sub: ' + payload.sub);",
									"console.log('Roles: ' + JSON.stringify(payload.roles));",
									"console.log('user_id: ' + payload.user_id);",
									"var exp = new Date(payload.exp * 1000);",
									"console.log('Expira em: ' + exp.toISOString());",
									"tests['Token valido'] = payload.exp > (Date.now() / 1000);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": "https://jwt.io",
						"description": "Apenas para debug. O payload do token salvo sera impresso no console do Postman (View > Show Postman Console). Nao envia nenhuma requisicao real."
					}
				}
			]
		},
